I implemented square using numpy.square so that one operation works for both numerical scalars and arrays of different dimensions. I tested the function with an integer scalar, a floating-point scalar, a one-dimensional NumPy array, and a two-dimensional NumPy array. I also used Python's doctest module to check the example in the function docstring.

